 that chapter of history closed when the Keldon invented the warp drive that enabled travel to distant planets and solar systems...", "summary": "Pardus is a free award-winning, real-time graphical game set in a futuristic universe that can be played right from your browser!\nTest your wits against thousands of others in this vast, persistent universe as you struggle to survive! Trading, pirating, smuggling, military ranking - how you play is totally up to you in this open-ended game set in space.\nPlayable with all common web browsers - No downloads or plug-ins required!", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pardus", "videos": [{"id": 161803, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "QjBAbqWw51g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QjBAbqWw51g", "title": "*Bonus* Pegasus starbase capture Pt.1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QjBAbqWw51g/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 161804, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "-Lti4YmKSI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Lti4YmKSI8", "title": "PARDUS gameplay video #1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-Lti4YmKSI8/hqdefault.jpg"}]}